    <string name="help_auto_routing_body">Free services first; if one runs out, the app moves to the next.</string>
    <string name="help_my_keys_body">Everyone adds their own free keys. They are encrypted and stay on your phone.</string>
    <string name="help_login_videos_body">Some videos can only be downloaded when signed in (private, closed accounts, or when Instagram or YouTube asks you to log in). Connect your account only if you see that prompt. Your data stays on your phone.</string>
